<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>FarmLink AI</title><style>
body{margin:0;font-family:Arial;background:#f6faf7;color:#17352a}nav{padding:18px 7%;background:white;display:flex;justify-content:space-between}.logo{font-size:25px;font-weight:bold;color:#176b43}button{background:#176b43;color:white;border:0;padding:12px 20px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:bold}.hero{padding:70px 8%;background:#e5f4e9}.hero h1{font-size:48px}.hero p{max-width:700px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.6}.card{background:white;padding:25px;border-radius:14px;margin:15px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px #0001}.grid{display:flex;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap}.grid .card{width:260px}section{padding:55px 8%;text-align:center}.compare{background:#edf7f0}input,select{padding:13px;margin:7px;border:1px solid #ccc;border-radius:8px}.results{display:none}.buyers{display:flex;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap}.buyer{background:white;padding:20px;margin:10px;border-radius:12px;width:300px}.recommended{border:2px solid #78b34a}.net{font-size:28px;color:#176b43;font-weight:bold}.steps{display:flex;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap}.step{background:white;padding:20px;margin:10px;width:210px;border-radius:12px}footer{background:#17352a;color:white;padding:30px;text-align:center}@media(max-width:600px){.hero h1{font-size:36px}}
</style></head><body>
<nav><div class="logo">🌾 FarmLink AI</div><button onclick="document.getElementById('compare').scrollIntoView()">Find Best Market</button></nav>
<div class="hero"><h1>Smarter Markets.<br>Better Returns for Farmers.</h1><p>FarmLink AI connects farmers and FPOs directly with consumers, retailers, restaurants, processors and bulk buyers. Our AI helps farmers find the market that gives the <b>highest net return</b>, not just the highest price.</p><button onclick="document.getElementById('compare').scrollIntoView()">Compare My Options →</button></div>
<section><h2>Why FarmLink AI?</h2><div class="grid"><div class="card">💰<h3>Net Realization</h3><p>Compare prices after deducting transport and logistics costs.</p></div><div class="card">🤖<h3>AI Forecasting</h3><p>Predict future demand and suggest when to sell.</p></div><div class="card">🚚<h3>Smart Logistics</h3><p>Optimize routes and combine nearby farmer shipments.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="compare" id="compare"><h2>Find Your Best Selling Option</h2><p>Compare buyers based on actual profit.</p><select id="crop"><option>Tomato</option><option>Onion</option><option>Wheat</option><option>Soybean</option></select><input id="qty" type="number" value="1000" placeholder="Quantity in kg"><input placeholder="Location"><br><button onclick="compare()">🤖 Analyze Best Market</button><div class="results" id="results"><h3>AI Market Recommendation</h3><div class="buyers"><div class="buyer"><h3>Buyer A – Mumbai Mandi</h3><p>Offered Price: ₹30/kg</p><p>Transport Cost: ₹5/kg</p><div>Net Realization</div><div class="net">₹25/kg</div></div><div class="buyer recommended"><b>✓ AI RECOMMENDED</b><h3>Buyer B – Local Retailer</h3><p>Offered Price: ₹28/kg</p><p>Transport Cost: ₹1/kg</p><div>Net Realization</div><div class="net">₹27/kg</div><p>Higher actual profit despite lower price!</p></div></div></div></section>
<section><h2>How It Works</h2><div class="steps"><div class="step">1️⃣<h3>List Produce</h3><p>Enter crop, quantity and location.</p></div><div class="step">2️⃣<h3>AI Compares</h3><p>Compare markets, buyers and costs.</p></div><div class="step">3️⃣<h3>AI Recommends</h3><p>Find where and when to sell.</p></div><div class="step">4️⃣<h3>Smart Delivery</h3><p>Get optimized logistics routes.</p></div></div></section>
<section><h2>Three Questions We Solve</h2><div class="grid"><div class="card"><h3>📍 Where?</h3><p>Which market is best?</p></div><div class="card"><h3>📅 When?</h3><p>What is the best time to sell?</p></div><div class="card"><h3>💰 Who?</h3><p>Which buyer gives the highest net return?</p></div></div></section>
<footer><h2>🌾 FarmLink AI</h2><p>Connecting Farmers to Better Markets and Better Returns</p><p>Smart India Hackathon Prototype</p></footer>
<script>function compare(){document.getElementById('results').style.display='block';}</script>
<style>
.extra-section{padding:58px 7%;background:#f0f8f2;color:#17352a}.extra-section .wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:auto}.extra-section h2{font-size:2rem;margin:0 0 10px}.extra-muted{color:#64756b}.extra-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;margin-top:24px}.extra-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #dce9e0;border-radius:16px;padding:20px}.extra-card h3{margin:8px 0}.extra-card p{color:#64756b;margin:0}.forecast-demo{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px;margin-top:22px}.forecast-demo ul{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0}.forecast-demo li{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e1eae3}.extra-pill{background:#e4f5e9;color:#176b45;padding:4px 8px;border-radius:7px;font-weight:750;font-size:.8rem}.net-demo{background:#fff;border:1px solid #dce9e0;border-radius:16px;padding:22px;margin-top:20px;overflow:auto}.net-demo input,.net-demo select{padding:10px;border:1px solid #cbdcd0;border-radius:8px;margin:5px 0 12px;width:100%}.net-demo button{background:#176b45;color:white;border:0;border-radius:9px;padding:11px 15px;font-weight:bold}.net-demo table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:15px}.net-demo td,.net-demo th{padding:10px;text-align:left;border-bottom:1px solid #e1eae3}.extra-note{font-size:.82rem;color:#64756b;margin-top:12px}
@media(max-width:750px){.extra-grid,.forecast-demo{grid-template-columns:1fr}.extra-section{padding:42px 5%}}
</style>
<section class="extra-section" id="demand-forecast"><div class="wrap">
<div style="text-align:center"><span class="extra-pill">NEW FEATURE</span><h2 style="margin-top:12px">AI Demand Forecasting</h2><p class="extra-muted">Plan what to sell and when, using demand signals instead of guesswork.</p></div>
<div class="extra-grid">
<div class="extra-card"><div style="font-size:1.6rem">📈</div><h3>Demand prediction</h3><p>Estimate upcoming crop demand from historical orders, seasonal patterns and buyer enquiries.</p></div>
<div class="extra-card"><div style="font-size:1.6rem">🗓️</div><h3>Harvest planning</h3><p>Align harvest and dispatch with buyer requirements to help reduce unsold produce and waste.</p></div>
<div class="extra-card"><div style="font-size:1.6rem">🌦️</div><h3>Market signals</h3><p>Bring together weather, seasonality and market trends to support better planning decisions.</p></div>
</div>
<div class="forecast-demo">
<div class="extra-card"><h3>Example demand outlook</h3><ul><li><span>Tomatoes</span><span class="extra-pill">High ↑</span></li><li><span>Onions</span><span class="extra-pill">Moderate ↑</span></li><li><span>Spinach</span><span class="extra-pill">Stable →</span></li><li><span>Capsicum</span><span class="extra-pill">Low ↓</span></li></ul><p class="extra-note">Illustrative sample only; not a live forecast.</p></div>
<div class="extra-card"><h3>Suggested actions</h3><ul><li><span>Check buyer orders</span><strong>Today</strong></li><li><span>Compare nearby prices</span><strong>Before dispatch</strong></li><li><span>Match harvest to demand</span><strong>Weekly</strong></li><li><span>Plan shared transport</span><strong>When possible</strong></li></ul><p class="extra-note">Actual AI predictions require reliable market, order and seasonal data.</p></div>
</div></div></section>
<section class="extra-section" id="net-return" style="background:#fff"><div class="wrap"><div style="text-align:center"><h2>Compare your real net return</h2><p class="extra-muted">The highest offer is not always the most profitable after transport costs.</p></div>
<div class="net-demo"><label for="cropName">Crop</label><select id="cropName"><option>Tomatoes</option><option>Onions</option><option>Potatoes</option><option>Spinach</option><option>Capsicum</option></select><label for="cropQty">Quantity (kg)</label><input id="cropQty" type="number" min="1" value="500"><label for="cropLoc">Location</label><input id="cropLoc" value="Pune"><button id="compareBtn" type="button">Compare sample buyers</button><table><thead><tr><th>Buyer</th><th>Offer/kg</th><th>Transport/kg</th><th>Net/kg</th><th>Net total</th></tr></thead><tbody id="netRows"><tr><td>City Mandi</td><td>₹30</td><td>₹5</td><td>₹25</td><td>₹12,500</td></tr><tr><td>Local Retailer</td><td>₹28</td><td>₹1</td><td>₹27</td><td>₹13,500</td></tr><tr><td>Bulk Buyer</td><td>₹29</td><td>₹3</td><td>₹26</td><td>₹13,000</td></tr></tbody></table><p id="netResult"><strong>Recommended sample option: Local Retailer</strong> — ₹27/kg net.</p><p class="extra-note">Demo figures only. Prices, transport costs and buyer availability are not live data.</p></div></div></section>
<script>
document.getElementById('compareBtn').addEventListener('click',function(){const qty=Math.max(1,Number(document.getElementById('cropQty').value)||1);const crop=document.getElementById('cropName').value;const loc=document.getElementById('cropLoc').value||'your location';const buyers=[{name:'City Mandi',price:30,cost:5},{name:'Local Retailer',price:28,cost:1},{name:'Bulk Buyer',price:29,cost:3}].map(x=>({...x,net:x.price-x.cost,total:(x.price-x.cost)*qty})).sort((a,b)=>b.net-a.net);document.getElementById('netRows').innerHTML=buyers.map(x=>`<tr><td>${x.name}</td><td>₹${x.price.toFixed(2)}</td><td>₹${x.cost.toFixed(2)}</td><td><strong>₹${x.net.toFixed(2)}</strong></td><td>₹${x.total.toLocaleString('en-IN')}</td></tr>`).join('');document.getElementById('netResult').innerHTML=`<strong>Best sample option for ${crop} near ${loc}: ${buyers[0].name}</strong> — ₹${buyers[0].net}/kg net, or ₹${buyers[0].total.toLocaleString('en-IN')} for ${qty.toLocaleString('en-IN')} kg.`;});
</script>

</body></html>